WEBVTT

00:02.335 --> 00:03.670
Good morning.

00:12.512 --> 00:13.346
What?

00:21.938 --> 00:24.232
Which one are you right now?

00:25.400 --> 00:28.194
You look like…

00:28.278 --> 00:32.198
I'm Satoru Gojo, the person in charge
of the first-years at Jujutsu High.

00:33.158 --> 00:34.492
Jujutsu…

00:34.576 --> 00:37.454
Fushiguro--

00:37.537 --> 00:38.580
What?

00:41.332 --> 00:43.168
What is this?

00:45.336 --> 00:49.591
It is not the time to worry
about other people, Yuji Itadori.

00:51.009 --> 00:54.220
A secret execution
has been imposed on you.

02:28.439 --> 02:29.440
ITADORI RESIDENCE

02:29.524 --> 02:30.692
Hello, this is Sugisawa--

02:30.775 --> 02:31.818
I'm Itadori.

02:31.901 --> 02:33.236
The one who just called.

02:33.820 --> 02:35.572
Yes.

02:35.655 --> 02:39.325
I haven't heard any reply.
Did my grandpa say anything?

02:39.409 --> 02:42.328
That's strange. I've told him.

02:42.829 --> 02:46.708
Wait. I'll ask.

02:49.544 --> 02:52.213
Mr. Itadori never rings the nurse's bell.

02:52.297 --> 02:54.090
It's actually kind of scary.

02:54.674 --> 02:56.676
Mr. Itadori, you have a call.

02:56.759 --> 02:58.303
Yuji is asking if there's anything

02:58.386 --> 03:00.305
-you want him to bring--
-So noisy!

03:00.388 --> 03:01.806
Tell him not to come.

03:01.890 --> 03:04.225
Enjoy the club activities. Join the club.

03:05.268 --> 03:07.729
What's going on?

03:08.813 --> 03:11.524
Did you hear that, Yuji?
And the one about the club?

03:12.734 --> 03:13.943
Thank you.

03:14.027 --> 03:16.321
I'll be there tomorrow afternoon.

03:18.698 --> 03:20.658
MIYAGI SUGISAWA MUNICIPAL HIGH SCHOOL

03:30.376 --> 03:35.256
It's silly to keep a Special Grade Curse
in a place like this.

03:36.549 --> 03:37.508
What?

03:48.061 --> 03:49.687
-I couldn't find it.
-What?

03:50.188 --> 03:52.023
The instrument shelter is empty.

03:52.106 --> 03:53.233
Are you serious?

03:53.316 --> 03:55.860
That's funny.
Maybe it went for a walk at night?

03:55.944 --> 03:57.153
I'm going to hit you.

03:57.237 --> 04:00.573
Well, you can't come back without that.

04:02.992 --> 04:05.119
I'll punch him next time.

04:05.203 --> 04:07.622
CONGRATULATIONS, SOCCER CLUB

04:10.667 --> 04:11.918
It's about to start.

04:12.001 --> 04:13.878
Are you ready?

04:13.962 --> 04:16.005
Sasaki.

04:16.089 --> 04:18.132
Iguchi.

04:18.216 --> 04:20.385
Here we go.

04:20.468 --> 04:22.512
Spirits.

04:22.595 --> 04:25.139
Tell me what animal
the council president is afraid of.

04:27.100 --> 04:28.851
-Naked.
-Sea.

04:28.935 --> 04:30.228
-Butterfly.
-Butterfly.

04:30.311 --> 04:33.481
Naked sea butterfly? That is so lame.

04:33.564 --> 04:34.482
Occult Club!

04:34.983 --> 04:37.443
Hey, it's the plankton president!
What's up?

04:37.527 --> 04:38.403
NOTICE

04:38.486 --> 04:41.114
This research club
doesn't have any real-world activity.

04:41.197 --> 04:43.783
We'll take back the activity room
according to the notice.

04:43.866 --> 04:45.159
Please withdraw quickly.

04:45.243 --> 04:49.455
You shouldn't underestimate
my seniors, President.

04:49.539 --> 04:51.207
STRANGE EVENT ARCHIVES

04:52.000 --> 04:53.126
What's that?

04:54.585 --> 04:57.714
You know the rugby field
is locked up, right?

04:57.797 --> 05:01.676
Yes, because all the players
have been hospitalized with sickness.

05:01.759 --> 05:03.636
Don't you find it strange?

05:03.720 --> 05:06.014
Rugby players are strong and healthy.

05:06.097 --> 05:09.225
It is said that they heard
strange noises and cries…

05:09.309 --> 05:10.393
BONK

05:10.977 --> 05:13.896
…before they fell ill.

05:13.980 --> 05:17.317
Let's take a look at this news report
from 30 years ago.

05:17.400 --> 05:20.903
The disappearance of Mr. Yoshida
from the construction company.

05:20.987 --> 05:23.239
The last witness information
comes from here.

05:23.323 --> 05:25.908
Sugisawa Municipal High School
during construction.

05:25.992 --> 05:26.909
What?

05:26.993 --> 05:28.995
Mr. Yoshida, who was running out of money,

05:29.078 --> 05:32.915
loaned from loan sharks
and was targeted by the group behind it.

05:33.499 --> 05:36.085
This series of disturbances

05:36.169 --> 05:41.257
was the grievance of Mr. Yoshida,
who was buried under the rugby field.

05:41.340 --> 05:43.426
No, it's Ixodes.

05:45.094 --> 05:46.387
Ixodes.

05:46.471 --> 05:48.306
A large, blood-sucking insect.

05:48.389 --> 05:51.267
SFTS caused by a bite could be fatal.

05:51.350 --> 05:52.310
Be careful.

05:52.393 --> 05:53.770
So what?

05:53.853 --> 05:56.022
The club is trying
to unravel psychic phenomena.

05:56.105 --> 05:58.191
That's a serious
activity report, isn't it?

05:58.274 --> 05:59.859
This is no place for child's play!

05:59.942 --> 06:01.694
The biggest problem, in the end, is…

06:01.778 --> 06:03.071
-Yuji Itadori!
-What?

06:03.154 --> 06:05.698
You're not in the Occult Club,
you're in track and field.

06:05.782 --> 06:08.701
So this club did not meet
the minimum requirement

06:08.785 --> 06:10.161
of three people as stated.

06:10.244 --> 06:11.079
What?

06:11.162 --> 06:12.497
Itadori.

06:12.580 --> 06:14.665
No, I wrote the Occult Club.

06:14.749 --> 06:16.667
I rewrote it.

06:16.751 --> 06:19.087
Takagi, the track and field coach.

06:19.170 --> 06:22.048
Itadori, we need you
to win this national competition!

06:22.715 --> 06:25.718
A teacher who is worse
than the students appears…

06:26.302 --> 06:29.138
You're so annoying!
How many times do I have to say no?

06:29.222 --> 06:30.681
-You can't say no!
-I can't?

06:30.765 --> 06:32.642
But I'm not a demon either.

06:32.725 --> 06:35.103
If you win,
I'll give up making you participate.

06:35.186 --> 06:38.606
Let's compete fair and square,
with track-and-field items!

06:38.689 --> 06:41.275
Sounds interesting. Let's do this!

06:41.359 --> 06:43.402
TRACK AND FIELD COACH TAKAGI VS. ITADORI

06:44.153 --> 06:47.949
Is it a good thing
to rewrite people's applications?

06:52.620 --> 06:54.997
What's wrong with the rugby field?

06:57.625 --> 06:59.710
Is a corpse buried down there?

07:00.837 --> 07:02.088
Even so,

07:02.880 --> 07:07.135
this curse is supposed to be
a Grade 2 Curse.

07:07.885 --> 07:09.554
Is that the effect of the curse?

07:11.722 --> 07:15.059
I can't pinpoint the location
because the cursed breath is too strong.

07:15.143 --> 07:19.147
It could be at your feet
or in the distance.

07:19.730 --> 07:22.400
This Special Grade Curse is too tricky.

07:23.359 --> 07:26.571
Who brought it out? Where is it now?

07:27.447 --> 07:28.781
Come!

07:28.865 --> 07:32.034
Takagi and Itadori are competing.

07:32.118 --> 07:34.203
What are they competing for?

07:36.539 --> 07:37.790
Okay.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.460
Fourteen meters.

07:40.543 --> 07:41.961
JAPAN RECORDS
18M, 85CM

07:42.044 --> 07:44.755
Takagi is so strong,
old but still vigorous.

07:44.839 --> 07:45.965
Itadori, can you do it?

07:46.048 --> 07:48.634
-Is Itadori famous?
-Itadori!

07:48.718 --> 07:51.637
I just heard that
he made it through SASUKE.

07:51.721 --> 07:54.432
They call him
the reincarnation of Mirko Cro Cop.

07:55.016 --> 07:56.851
Mirko hasn't died yet, right?

07:57.518 --> 08:00.062
He's called
the "Tiger of West Junior High."

08:00.146 --> 08:01.189
Too corny!

08:01.272 --> 08:03.524
Can I just throw it out?

08:03.608 --> 08:06.694
Well, there's no rule
to decide how to throw it.

08:06.777 --> 08:11.657
Sorry for choosing your unprofessional
category to convey my sincerity.

08:15.661 --> 08:16.662
Well…

08:16.746 --> 08:19.165
That's about 30 meters.

08:19.248 --> 08:21.626
-Okay! I won!
-What?

08:21.709 --> 08:23.586
He's a gorilla, not a tiger.

08:23.669 --> 08:25.630
That was the pitcher's move
just now, right?

08:26.214 --> 08:29.133
Itadori, you're more suitable
for sports clubs.

08:29.217 --> 08:32.220
You don't have to force yourself
to stay at the Occult Club.

08:32.303 --> 08:33.262
What?

08:33.346 --> 08:35.932
You two like horror stories,

08:36.015 --> 08:39.101
but you can't go
to haunted places without me.

08:39.185 --> 08:40.728
I'm scared because I like it.

08:40.811 --> 08:43.648
And our school says that
it's compulsory to join a club, right?

08:43.731 --> 08:45.358
I can't play this kind of thing.

08:45.441 --> 08:48.236
You don't have to do anything,
just a "ghost member."

08:48.319 --> 08:49.946
It's the Occult Club anyway.

08:50.446 --> 08:51.864
That's what I said.

08:51.948 --> 08:54.951
I have to go home by five
for personal reasons.

08:55.034 --> 08:56.869
If you don't mind, let me stay.

08:56.953 --> 09:00.122
I also like the atmosphere
of the Occult Club.

09:00.206 --> 09:02.625
We don't mind that.

09:02.708 --> 09:04.001
Yes.

09:05.002 --> 09:06.587
That guy is amazing.

09:06.671 --> 09:09.465
He can do that much without cursed energy?

09:09.549 --> 09:11.968
Maybe he's similar to Zenin.

09:12.051 --> 09:14.637
It's late!

09:14.720 --> 09:17.348
I'm leaving early
since I have matters to attend to, Coach!

09:26.774 --> 09:28.442
The breath of the cursed object.

09:28.526 --> 09:29.902
Hey, slow down.

09:29.986 --> 09:31.529
Isn't he too fast?

09:31.612 --> 09:34.448
I heard that guy ran
50 meters in 3 seconds.

09:34.532 --> 09:35.825
Is he a person or a car?

09:46.961 --> 09:49.380
SUGISAWA HOSPITAL

09:49.463 --> 09:51.382
I told you not to come.

09:51.465 --> 09:53.926
Don't keep buying flowers.

09:54.010 --> 09:55.344
It's the same as usual.

09:55.428 --> 09:58.097
The flowers aren't for you,
they are for the nurse.

09:58.180 --> 09:59.890
That's even more redundant, you fool!

09:59.974 --> 10:03.144
What happened to your club?
Enjoy the club activities.

10:03.227 --> 10:06.814
Stop nagging. It was over at five.

10:06.897 --> 10:10.026
I wouldn't have come to see you
if I didn't have time.

10:10.109 --> 10:11.235
Okay.

10:11.319 --> 10:14.238
You'll just have to listen to me,
a man of leisure.

10:14.322 --> 10:15.823
I'm not interested.

10:15.906 --> 10:17.366
Listen to me carefully.

10:17.450 --> 10:19.702
I have one last thing to tell you.

10:20.202 --> 10:21.495
About your parents--

10:21.579 --> 10:24.248
I told you I'm not interested.

10:24.832 --> 10:28.210
Please don't act all cool
before you die, okay?

10:28.294 --> 10:33.924
Men are supposed to die acting cool.
Don't you understand, my damn grandson?

10:34.425 --> 10:36.177
Don't get angry all the time.

10:36.886 --> 10:38.679
Just be yourself.

10:40.681 --> 10:43.059
The pressure-free generation
is ridiculous!

10:49.440 --> 10:50.650
Yuji.

10:50.733 --> 10:51.651
Yes?

10:51.734 --> 10:54.862
You're strong enough to save others.

10:54.945 --> 10:56.906
As far as you can go…

10:56.989 --> 10:59.158
If you can, try to save them.

10:59.241 --> 11:00.451
It's okay to be confused.

11:00.534 --> 11:03.245
Don't worry about it
if you don't get any gratitude.

11:03.829 --> 11:06.499
Anyway, try to save more people.

11:07.291 --> 11:10.461
You're going to die
in front of a crowd of people.

11:11.212 --> 11:13.506
Don't be like me.

11:24.558 --> 11:25.601
Grandpa.

11:26.185 --> 11:28.062
NURSE CALL

11:28.687 --> 11:30.648
Yes? What's wrong?

11:32.900 --> 11:35.277
Hello, Mr. Itadori?

11:38.531 --> 11:39.824
Are you there?

11:42.368 --> 11:45.246
Grandpa passed away.

12:07.768 --> 12:09.687
DEATH CERTIFICATE

12:11.313 --> 12:14.358
Well, that's all the documents I need.

12:14.442 --> 12:16.735
Okay, thank you for your care.

12:16.819 --> 12:18.446
Are you really okay?

12:19.029 --> 12:21.449
It's the first time
I'm experiencing a loss,

12:21.532 --> 12:24.452
so maybe
it doesn't feel like it's real yet.

12:24.952 --> 12:29.331
But my grandpa's going to get mad
at me for frowning so much.

12:29.832 --> 12:32.042
I'll just smile while I burn him up.

12:32.126 --> 12:33.544
Don't say it like that.

12:35.546 --> 12:36.964
Are you Yuji Itadori?

12:38.549 --> 12:40.801
I'm Fushiguro from Jujutsu High.

12:41.302 --> 12:43.471
I have something to tell you now.

12:44.054 --> 12:45.973
Well, I'm in mourning.

12:46.056 --> 12:47.766
Sorry, I don't have time.

12:47.850 --> 12:50.478
The cursed object on your hand
is very dangerous.

12:50.561 --> 12:52.062
Please give it to me right away.

12:52.146 --> 12:53.397
"The cursed object"?

12:53.898 --> 12:55.024
This one.

12:55.941 --> 12:58.194
Oh, that one! I picked it up.

12:58.777 --> 13:02.615
I don't care,
but my seniors are very interested.

13:02.698 --> 13:04.200
Why is that dangerous?

13:05.201 --> 13:08.829
The number of unidentified deaths
and missing persons in Japan

13:08.913 --> 13:10.915
exceeds 10,000 annually.

13:11.874 --> 13:14.335
Most of them were caused by the "curse."

13:15.252 --> 13:16.587
"Curse"?

13:16.670 --> 13:20.132
Believe it or not, this is the truth.

13:20.216 --> 13:21.634
I'll go on.

13:22.384 --> 13:26.263
Resentment gathers easily
in schools and hospitals.

13:26.347 --> 13:29.099
Pain, regret, shame…

13:29.183 --> 13:32.645
Humanity's negative emotions
are the source of the curse.

13:32.728 --> 13:37.107
That's why many schools
keep secret "exorcism" curses.

13:37.733 --> 13:39.610
The one you got is also one of them.

13:39.693 --> 13:42.488
Since it's an exorcism,
isn't it a good thing?

13:42.571 --> 13:43.739
Let me finish.

13:44.532 --> 13:47.826
By keeping the evil cursed object,
one can keep away other curses.

13:47.910 --> 13:49.119
It's highly poisonous.

13:49.828 --> 13:51.956
Demon exorcism is nothing but a vice.

13:53.165 --> 13:55.626
Its seal loosened year by year.

13:55.709 --> 13:59.463
Now it's bait to invoke the curse
and make it grow.

14:01.173 --> 14:05.553
The one you've got is classified
as a "super hazardous material."

14:05.636 --> 14:07.555
Hand it over before someone dies.

14:07.638 --> 14:11.767
I told you that I don't mind,
go and see my seniors.

14:13.394 --> 14:14.270
It's empty.

14:14.353 --> 14:17.273
All I'm tracking is the rubbish
attached to the box.

14:19.358 --> 14:20.526
Where's the thing inside?

14:20.609 --> 14:23.529
I told you, it's with my senior…

14:24.280 --> 14:25.197
What happened?

14:25.281 --> 14:29.034
Yes, they said they were going to reveal
the symbol at school tonight.

14:29.535 --> 14:30.452
What?

14:31.453 --> 14:33.789
Is something serious going on?

14:35.541 --> 14:37.501
It's not just that.

14:38.085 --> 14:40.462
They are going to die.

14:45.342 --> 14:47.052
I can't take it off.

14:47.136 --> 14:49.638
Do we really have
to sneak in here to do this?

14:49.722 --> 14:51.140
Turn on the lights.

14:51.223 --> 14:53.350
No, don't ruin the mood.

14:53.434 --> 14:56.395
Feeling stimulation is the essence
of the Occult Club.

14:56.478 --> 14:58.731
Don't worry, nothing will happen.

15:00.441 --> 15:01.525
I took it down.

15:15.581 --> 15:17.666
Human finger.

15:18.167 --> 15:19.460
A real finger?

15:23.672 --> 15:24.840
This is…

15:28.302 --> 15:29.637
What happened?

15:33.182 --> 15:35.559
Was it easy to reveal the symbols?

15:35.643 --> 15:38.646
A man without cursed energy can't do it.

15:39.146 --> 15:40.731
Normally, it is.

15:41.231 --> 15:43.150
Move to the right.

15:43.233 --> 15:45.444
The content is too strong this time.

15:45.527 --> 15:48.197
The seal is too old.
It's just an old paper now.

15:48.280 --> 15:52.284
But I still can't imagine
what you said about the curse.

15:52.368 --> 15:53.619
Where are they?

15:53.702 --> 15:54.870
Fourth floor.

15:59.041 --> 16:01.085
What's with the pressure?

16:01.168 --> 16:02.544
You stay here.

16:04.046 --> 16:06.423
I'm coming too! It's dangerous, right?

16:06.507 --> 16:08.550
Even though I just met them,

16:08.634 --> 16:11.136
they are my friends,
so I can't just leave it alone.

16:12.554 --> 16:13.764
Stay here.

16:14.515 --> 16:17.184
OCCULT PHENOMENON RESEARCH CLUB

16:17.810 --> 16:24.108
What time is it?

16:25.317 --> 16:32.074
The hour hand points to 11…

16:32.157 --> 16:34.159
What's wrong with that monster?

16:34.243 --> 16:36.036
Sasaki.

16:36.120 --> 16:38.872
Iguchi, thank goodness!
Where have you been?

16:38.956 --> 16:42.251
Help me…

16:45.587 --> 16:48.173
What time is it?

16:48.257 --> 16:50.134
The curse has been activated.

16:50.217 --> 16:52.302
The breath is still strong.

16:55.597 --> 16:57.433
Don't get in the way.

16:57.516 --> 16:58.475
Divine Dogs!

17:05.816 --> 17:07.735
Go ahead and eat it.

17:08.861 --> 17:12.322
Can I just listen to him and wait here?

17:12.990 --> 17:15.743
What am I afraid of?

17:16.326 --> 17:18.328
They are going to die.

17:18.912 --> 17:21.999
Yes, the breath of death is approaching.

17:22.082 --> 17:23.625
I'm afraid of death.

17:24.251 --> 17:28.047
Am I scared? I don't even feel it at all.

17:29.173 --> 17:31.175
I cried not because I was scared,

17:31.800 --> 17:33.385
but because I'm lonely.

17:34.053 --> 17:38.098
Grandpa's death and the death
that might happen in front of me now.

17:38.182 --> 17:40.184
What's the difference?

17:41.351 --> 17:44.063
You're strong enough to save others.

17:50.402 --> 17:53.572
The number of curses has increased.
It's very close.

18:01.163 --> 18:02.581
Found it.

18:04.333 --> 18:06.251
He's bad-tempered and stubborn.

18:06.335 --> 18:09.254
No one will come to see him except me.

18:10.756 --> 18:12.716
He said, "Don't be like me."

18:13.383 --> 18:14.760
He was right.

18:14.843 --> 18:17.971
Are you trying to swallow
humans and cursed objects together?

18:19.765 --> 18:20.933
It's too late.

18:30.692 --> 18:31.652
Itadori.

18:31.735 --> 18:35.114
I think Grandpa's death is correct.

18:36.031 --> 18:37.658
But…

18:39.743 --> 18:40.911
The death here…

18:43.038 --> 18:45.082
It's incorrect!

18:49.878 --> 18:51.421
Is that a curse?

18:51.505 --> 18:53.173
It's different from what I thought.

18:58.095 --> 19:00.305
I was going to ask you why you're here.

19:00.389 --> 19:01.765
But you did a good job.

19:01.849 --> 19:03.308
Why are you so self-important?

19:03.976 --> 19:07.563
What are those creatures
eating the curse hungrily?

19:07.646 --> 19:09.106
It's my Shikigami.

19:09.189 --> 19:10.399
Can you see it?

19:11.150 --> 19:13.152
Normally, people can't see a curse.

19:13.235 --> 19:16.280
Only when you're on your deathbed
or in this particular situation.

19:16.363 --> 19:18.115
Oh, really?

19:18.198 --> 19:20.826
I've never seen a ghost before.

19:21.910 --> 19:23.829
Aren't you scared?

19:23.912 --> 19:26.456
I was really scared.

19:26.957 --> 19:29.793
But you know, humans will really die.

19:29.877 --> 19:30.794
What?

19:31.378 --> 19:36.049
So I should at least let the person
I know get the right death.

19:36.133 --> 19:38.427
Well, I don't get it either.

19:38.510 --> 19:40.429
Oh, my. Is this it?

19:40.512 --> 19:44.266
Yes. A Special Grade Curse,
the finger of Ryomen Sukuna.

19:44.349 --> 19:46.768
It's a miracle she didn't get eaten
together with it.

19:46.852 --> 19:49.062
Why would it eat this? Is it delicious?

19:49.146 --> 19:50.063
What nonsense.

19:50.147 --> 19:52.566
It is to level-up your curse power.

19:52.649 --> 19:54.568
It's dangerous, so give it to me.

19:54.651 --> 19:56.153
Okay.

20:01.074 --> 20:02.409
Run!

20:11.084 --> 20:12.419
Fushiguro!

20:13.545 --> 20:14.880
Nue!

20:19.134 --> 20:20.552
What?

20:35.692 --> 20:39.696
I can't think anymore.

20:40.572 --> 20:44.993
Itadori, you should take them and run!

20:45.661 --> 20:48.330
Aren't you in danger too?

20:52.251 --> 20:56.213
A curse can only be exterminated
by a curse, you can't defeat it.

20:56.296 --> 20:58.048
It's not the time to say such things!

20:58.131 --> 21:00.425
You'll die at this rate!

21:01.635 --> 21:05.097
I would feel terrible if I left you now.

21:05.180 --> 21:06.348
And…

21:09.601 --> 21:11.103
There is a troublesome…

21:11.186 --> 21:13.105
Save others.

21:13.188 --> 21:16.275
…curse on me too.

21:25.993 --> 21:27.703
Stupid! Give it to me!

21:27.786 --> 21:29.538
You'll be swallowed too.

21:33.875 --> 21:36.003
Why would it eat this? Is it delicious?

21:36.086 --> 21:37.421
What nonsense.

21:37.504 --> 21:39.506
It is to level-up your curse power.

21:42.467 --> 21:45.554
Isn't that the way to save everyone?

21:45.637 --> 21:48.724
Can't I have a curse?

21:48.807 --> 21:50.058
Stop.

21:50.142 --> 21:51.727
No!

21:52.978 --> 21:56.440
Ryomen Sukuna's finger
is a Special Grade Curse.

21:56.523 --> 21:58.900
It is a poisonous thing, so he'll die.

21:58.984 --> 22:03.405
But what if…

22:44.404 --> 22:48.742
The moonlight is supposed to be felt!

22:49.534 --> 22:52.704
Oh, no! The worst possible
"what if" has happened.

22:52.788 --> 22:55.499
The Special Grade Curse
is parasitic on him.

22:55.582 --> 22:58.001
The flesh of the curse is too weak.

22:58.085 --> 23:01.088
Where are the humans and the women?

23:01.755 --> 23:04.674
This era is really nice.

23:04.758 --> 23:08.345
Women and children walk around
like maggots.

23:08.929 --> 23:10.639
It's wonderful.

23:10.722 --> 23:12.724
We can go on killing.

23:14.893 --> 23:15.769
What?

23:18.396 --> 23:20.357
What are you doing
with someone else's body?

23:20.440 --> 23:21.483
Give it back!

23:21.566 --> 23:23.985
Why are you moving?

23:24.069 --> 23:26.530
This is my body.

23:27.614 --> 23:29.616
He's suppressing me.

23:30.492 --> 23:31.827
Don't move!

23:31.910 --> 23:33.537
You're not human anymore.

23:33.620 --> 23:34.454
What?

23:35.997 --> 23:39.292
According to the sorcery law,
Yuji Itadori,

23:39.876 --> 23:41.962
as a Cursed Spirit, you will be…

23:42.462 --> 23:44.047
exorcised!
